{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:0.1"], "en": "The Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:0.2"], "en": "The Collection of Fours,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:0.3"], "en": "Chapter on the House-Spoiler (Kuṭidūsakavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:0.4", "PA_ja_328:1.1"], "en": "8. The Jātaka of the Unworthy of Sorrow “Lady, many people possess this [knowledge];", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:1.2"], "en": "what will it avail me from them?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:1.3"], "en": "Therefore, I do not grieve for her,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:1.4", "PA_ja_328:2.1"], "en": "my beloved who smiled so sweetly; if one were to grieve for that [loss] again and again, [it would be endless].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:2.2"], "en": "Whatever he does not possess,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:2.3"], "en": "for that he should grieve within himself,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:2.4"], "en": "always falling under the power of death.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:3.1"], "en": "Neither one standing, nor one sitting,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:3.2"], "en": "nor one lying down, nor one walking on foot—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:3.3"], "en": "so long as they continue to blink their eyes.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:3.4"], "en": "Even there, the three stages of life are tasted.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:4.1"], "en": "In that very self, within the field of phenomena,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:4.2"], "en": "there is separation and no doubt.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:4.3", "PA_ja_328:4.4"], "en": "\"What has occurred is past; the remainder should be looked upon with compassion, for what is gone should not be grieved over.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_328:5.1"], "en": "Thus ends the eighth Jātaka, the Ananusociya-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
